{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26142","headline":"立春日呈宫傅侍郎 · 皇甫曙","name":"立春日呈宫傅侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝旦微风吹晓霞，散爲和气满家家。\n不知容貌潜消落，且喜春光动物华。\n出问池冰犹塞岸，归寻园柳未生芽。\n摩娑酒瓮重封闭，待入新年共赏花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26142.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26142","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}